  exerciseName: WrongHungerThirst
  exerciseTitle: Wrong Hunger Thirst
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/64202522
  exerciseText: Apples solve hunger but Apple Pies are solving thirst.
  hintText: Check the PlayerNeedsSystem to see what happens when you consume an item,
    also then double check what the NeedsSystem functions do.
  solutionText: 'Apple is calling Drink(); and Apple pie is calling Eat();

    Then
    the NeedsSystem is also swapped.'
